74
00:03:22.919 --> 00:03:26.639
Now the world position offset lets us use our materials

75
00:03:26.639 --> 00:03:29.560
to move or deform parts of our 3D models,

76
00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:31.960
like in this case, these trees,

77
00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:36.449
by changing where their vertices appear in the world.

78
00:03:36.449 --> 00:03:41.449
So we can make grass sway, flags wave, object wobble,

79
00:03:41.770 --> 00:03:45.039
